  levelName: LevelTwo
  lines:
  - This isn't where my cage is! I've somehow made it to the kitchen, I need to look
    for the next mouse hole if I want to make it back to my cage!
  - This cheese could help me heal when hurt! Hopefully there is more around here
    somewhere...
  - 'Hint: Sparkling objects can be interacted with!'
